CREATE (:Discovery:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL` {content:\"Knowledge base maintenance workflow established: (1) Review tasks for duplicates/outdated/misclassified, (2) Create domain tasks as top-level containers, (3) Move tasks under appropriate domains using update_task with parent_id, (4) Convert non-tasks to correct node types (decisions, discoveries). Key tools needed: delete_task (added), update_task with parent_id (added), edge cleanup on move (added).\", created_at:\"2026-01-24T13:47:36.759423\", meta_context:\"First manual maintenance session\", meta_project_id:\"null\", meta_tags:\"[\\"source:agent\\", \\"workflow\\", \\"maintenance\\", \\"documentation\\"]\", type:\"discovery\", updated_at:\"2026-01-24T13:47:36.759435\", uuid:\"1a5e7803-38c6-4ada-b511-dd30f68f8950\", `UNIQUE IMPORT ID`:180});
CREATE (:Task:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL` {content:\"Fix knowledge capture - agent not recording thoughts consistently\n\n**Problem:** Despite hooks and reminders, the agent doesn't consistently record thoughts/decisions/discoveries during work. Thoughts are shallow (2 recorded for entire maintenance session) and many actions go undocumented.\n\n**Related problems:**\n- c989da28: Reminder hook failed to change behavior - agent completed 10-phase implementation without recording\n- 49d3d2b1: Same issue - hook injects reminder but agent ignores during focused work\n- 0d7d14f6: Subagents via Task tool don't receive hooks at all\n\n**Root cause hypotheses:**\n1. Cognitive load - too many options in reminder, agent skips all\n2. Task focus - \\"do mode\\" vs \\"reflect mode\\" conflict\n3. No enforcement - reminder is passive, not blocking\n4. Missing automation - should capture automatically, not require manual calls\n\n**Potential solutions:**\n1. Blocking pre-tool hook (must record thought before proceeding)\n2. Auto-capture from tool calls (add \\"reasoning\\" field to Edit/Write)\n3. Post-turn checkpoint instead of per-action\n4. Simpler single prompt \\"What are you thinking?\\"\", created_at:\"2026-01-24T13:50:40.453054\", meta_blocked_by:\"[]\", meta_depth:1, meta_description:\"**Problem:** Despite hooks and reminders, the agent doesn't consistently record thoughts/decisions/discoveries during work. Thoughts are shallow (2 recorded for entire maintenance session) and many actions go undocumented.\n\n**Related problems:**\n- c989da28: Reminder hook failed to change behavior - agent completed 10-phase implementation without recording\n- 49d3d2b1: Same issue - hook injects reminder but agent ignores during focused work\n- 0d7d14f6: Subagents via Task tool don't receive hooks at all\n\n**Root cause hypotheses:**\n1. Cognitive load - too many options in reminder, agent skips all\n2. Task focus - \\"do mode\\" vs \\"reflect mode\\" conflict\n3. No enforcement - reminder is passive, not blocking\n4. Missing automation - should capture automatically, not require manual calls\n\n**Potential solutions:**\n1. Blocking pre-tool hook (must record thought before proceeding)\n2. Auto-capture from tool calls (add \\"reasoning\\" field to Edit/Write)\n3. Post-turn checkpoint instead of per-action\n4. Simpler single prompt \\"What are you thinking?\\"\", meta_parent_id:\"bbc0e863-a4cb-4fc1-8550-bfcc762a2eb5\", meta_project_id:\"fc816fde-6aae-47fd-97b3-666e66ca09c1\", meta_status:\"pending\", meta_subject:\"Fix knowledge capture - agent not recording thoughts consistently\", type:\"task\", updated_at:\"2026-01-24T13:50:40.453059\", uuid:\"41a64772-f53f-4a19-b6c1-16088c8a72df\", `UNIQUE IMPORT ID`:181});
CREATE (:Task:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL` {content:\"Fix semantic search - search_knowledge returns empty results\n\n**Problem:** search_knowledge tool returns empty results even when matching nodes exist. Example: searching \\"GUI\\" returns 0 results despite GUI task existing.\n\n**Root cause:** _generate_query_embedding() in queries.py is a placeholder - creates naive 5-dim vectors based on length/char sums, no actual semantic understanding.\n\n**Related:** \n- Problem 9e9fe6c5: \\"Natural language search returns empty results\\"\n- Task: \\"Fix semantic search with real embeddings or hybrid approach\\"\n\n**Fix options:**\n1. Ollama local embeddings (nomic-embed-text)\n2. OpenAI embeddings API (costs money)\n3. Hybrid: structured filters + full-text search + optional vectors\", created_at:\"2026-01-24T13:51:58.766841\", meta_blocked_by:\"[]\", meta_depth:1, meta_description:\"**Problem:** search_knowledge tool returns empty results even when matching nodes exist. Example: searching \\"GUI\\" returns 0 results despite GUI task existing.\n\n**Root cause:** _generate_query_embedding() in queries.py is a placeholder - creates naive 5-dim vectors based on length/char sums, no actual semantic understanding.\n\n**Related:** \n- Problem 9e9fe6c5: \\"Natural language search returns empty results\\"\n- Task: \\"Fix semantic search with real embeddings or hybrid approach\\"\n\n**Fix options:**\n1. Ollama local embeddings (nomic-embed-text)\n2. OpenAI embeddings API (costs money)\n3. Hybrid: structured filters + full-text search + optional vectors\", meta_parent_id:\"bbc0e863-a4cb-4fc1-8550-bfcc762a2eb5\", meta_project_id:\"fc816fde-6aae-47fd-97b3-666e66ca09c1\", meta_status:\"pending\", meta_subject:\"Fix semantic search - search_knowledge returns empty results\", type:\"task\", updated_at:\"2026-01-24T13:51:58.766844\", uuid:\"2159433b-69b2-4778-896f-6fbb021e270b\", `UNIQUE IMPORT ID`:182});
CREATE (:Discovery:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL` {content:\"Knowledge base maintenance workflow documented:\n\n1. **Task Cleanup**: Review pending tasks for - already done (mark complete), similar (merge/delete), misclassified (convert to proper node type), outdated (delete)\n\n2. **Hierarchy Organization**: Create domain tasks (MCP, Agents, GUI, Infrastructure) as containers, move related tasks underneath using parent_id\n\n3. **Orphan Cleanup**: Find unlinked nodes (thoughts, discoveries) via Cypher queries, group by source/topic, link to relevant parent nodes\n\n4. **Edge Cleanup**: When moving tasks, old contains edges must be deleted before creating new ones - implemented in update_task()\n\n5. **Research Relinking**: Research outputs should be grouped by agent/topic, not chronologically - 3 parallel agents produced 6 thoughts linking to 4 decisions and 1 discovery\n\nTools created: delete_task with delete_subtasks option\nTools enhanced: update_task with parent_id for moving tasks + edge cleanup\", created_at:\"2026-01-24T14:00:23.859206\", meta_context:\"Completed manual knowledge base maintenance session\", meta_project_id:\"null\", meta_tags:\"[\\"maintenance\\", \\"workflow\\", \\"automation-candidate\\"]\", type:\"discovery\", updated_at:\"2026-01-24T14:00:23.859221\", uuid:\"039cd290-5ae2-41b2-a7a0-ac18b9b785c8\", `UNIQUE IMPORT ID`:183});
:commit
